# 預設忽略所有
*

# 只追蹤規則與核心設定檔案
!.gitignore
!README.md
!GEMINI.md
!rules/
!rules/*.md
!hooks/
!hooks/*.ps1
!settings.json

# 追蹤升級後之 /xlsx Skill 與四大開源公式引擎腳本 (排除 .venv 與 node_modules)
!config/
!config/skills/
!config/skills/xlsx/
!config/skills/xlsx/SKILL.md
!config/skills/xlsx/README.md
!config/skills/xlsx/LICENSE.txt
!config/skills/xlsx/recalc.py
!config/skills/xlsx/requirements.txt
!config/skills/xlsx/package.json
!config/skills/xlsx/references/
!config/skills/xlsx/references/*.md
!config/skills/xlsx/scripts/
!config/skills/xlsx/scripts/*.py
!config/skills/xlsx/scripts/*.js
